%description:

Tests that a VLAN policy module rejects a mapper key that is not the decimal form of a VLAN id in its map parameter at
initialization, naming the interface and the entry. Before the check, the entry
was ignored or failed only when a packet reached it. The network is the one of
lib/vlan-access-trunk.ini, with one malformed parameter.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
*.bridge1.bridging.vlanPolicy.outboundMapper.mappedVlanIds = {"eth0" : {"010" : -1}}
include ../../lib/vlan-access-trunk.ini

%exitcode: 1
%postrun-command: grep '<!>' test.out test.err > vlan-map-error.out || true
%contains: vlan-map-error.out
Invalid VLAN id key '010' in the mappedVlanIds entry for interface 'eth0': expected the decimal form of -1 or 0 to 4094
